			<div id="content" class="site-content">
		<div class="ast-container">
				<div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="4270" class="elementor elementor-4270" data-elementor-post-type="page">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-10adafd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="10adafd" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2031af1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="2031af1" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a474812 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="a474812" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<p class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">COMPANY</p>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-03db970 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="03db970" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Leadership</h1>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-61473bf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="61473bf" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>At DriveWealth, we have assembled a team of innovative, experienced, and passionate senior leaders. Their work at DriveWealth is informed by success as entrepreneurs, senior executives from major financial institutions, FINRA regulators, PhDs, tech innovators, and former military officers.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9d5b9dd e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="9d5b9dd" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a69a0b6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="a69a0b6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
					<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="https://www.drivewealth.com/contact/">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Get started</span>
					</span>
					</a>
				</div>
								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-78f901e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="78f901e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-aaff0d9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="aaff0d9" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8ff5ccb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="8ff5ccb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Meet our leadership team</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-15805c6 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="15805c6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">A strong organization is built based on the vision and strength of its leadership team.</h3>				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0599893 leadership e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="0599893" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-918cd09 person elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial" data-id="918cd09" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="testimonial.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-wrapper">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-content">Robert Cortright is the founder and executive chair.

Robert founded DriveWealth based on the belief that investing in the US stock market should be accessible globally and could be achieved by combining the right technology, creativity, and financial market wisdom.

Over his 30-year career, Robert served as a partner in Tachyon Capital Management, LLC, was a Co-Founder and Co-Chief Executive Officer of TAB Networks, Inc., Co-Founded and was Co-Chief Executive Officer of FX Solutions, LLC, and was also Co-Founder of Financial Labs LLC, which was purchased by Bank of America.

Robert earned a BA in Biochemistry and an MBA in International Finance from Lehigh University, and holds FINRA Series 3, 7, 24, 34, and 63 licenses.

He is a two-time winner of the Ernst &amp; Young Entrepreneur Of The Year award, having won in 2009 in New Jersey for co-founding FX Solutions, and again in 2026 in New York for founding DriveWealth.</div>
			
						<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta elementor-has-image elementor-testimonial-image-position-top">
				<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta-inner">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial-image">
							<img decoding="async" width="1000" height="1320" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/bob2.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-11006" alt="" srcset="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/bob2.png 1000w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/bob2-227x300.png 227w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/bob2-776x1024.png 776w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/bob2-768x1014.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" />						</div>
					
										<div class="elementor-testimonial-details">
														<div class="elementor-testimonial-name">Robert Cortright</div>
																						<div class="elementor-testimonial-job">Founder and Executive Chair</div>
													</div>
									</div>
			</div>
					</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ca117a3 person elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial" data-id="ca117a3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="testimonial.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-wrapper">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-content">Naureen Hassan is the Chief Executive Officer.

Naureen brings decades of experience driving digital transformation and operational excellence. Before joining DriveWealth, she served as President of UBS Americas, overseeing a $14 billion division with more than 20,000 employees and leading the US integration of Credit Suisse. Before UBS, she was previously First Vice President and Chief Operating Officer at the Federal Reserve Bank of New York, overseeing operations, technology, finance, and risk management. Earlier in her career, she served as Chief Digital Officer for Morgan Stanley Wealth Management and was Executive Vice President at Charles Schwab, where she led Investor Services segments, and served as COO of Schwab Bank. She began her career at McKinsey &amp; Company.

Naureen holds an AB degree from Princeton University, and a MBA from the Stanford University Graduate School of Business.</div>
			
						<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta elementor-has-image elementor-testimonial-image-position-top">
				<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta-inner">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial-image">
							<img decoding="async" width="1000" height="1320" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/naureen.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-10953" alt="" srcset="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/naureen.png 1000w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/naureen-227x300.png 227w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/naureen-776x1024.png 776w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/naureen-768x1014.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" />						</div>
					
										<div class="elementor-testimonial-details">
														<div class="elementor-testimonial-name">Naureen Hassan</div>
																						<div class="elementor-testimonial-job">Chief Executive Officer</div>
													</div>
									</div>
			</div>
					</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c418aaa person elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial" data-id="c418aaa" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="testimonial.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-wrapper">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-content">Marcus Anthony is the Chief Financial Officer.
 
Marcus most recently served as DriveWealth’s Chief Operating Officer before being promoted to Chief Financial Officer. Marcus joined DriveWealth from GCA Advisors after advising the company on its Series D capital raise in 2021. As an investment banker at GCA Advisors, he executed mergers and acquisitions, capital raising, and other strategic transactions for both public and private companies in the fintech and broader technology sectors. He was also an investment banker on the global mergers and acquisitions team at Barclays Capital where he advised corporations and private sponsors on complex mergers and acquisitions, carve-outs, and other transactions. Marcus is a former naval aviator and served as an officer in the United States Navy.
 
Marcus holds an MBA from Columbia Business School and a BS in Economics from the United States Naval Academy.</div>
			
						<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta elementor-has-image elementor-testimonial-image-position-top">
				<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta-inner">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial-image">
							<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="775" height="1024" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/marcus2.jpeg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-11017" alt="" srcset="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/marcus2.jpeg 775w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/marcus2-227x300.jpeg 227w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/marcus2-768x1015.jpeg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 775px) 100vw, 775px" />						</div>
					
										<div class="elementor-testimonial-details">
														<div class="elementor-testimonial-name">Marcus Anthony</div>
																						<div class="elementor-testimonial-job">Chief Financial Officer</div>
													</div>
									</div>
			</div>
					</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2c32807 person elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial" data-id="2c32807" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="testimonial.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-wrapper">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-content">Emily Chardac is the Chief People Officer.

Emily brings over 15 years of experience leading workforce transformation, scaling high-growth organizations, and preparing innovative companies for IPO. She leads our global talent, culture, and communications. Before joining DriveWealth, Emily was Chief People Officer at OnePay, where she was part of the founding executive team who scaled growth to a $2.5B valuation and multiple product launches. Previously, she served as a Managing Director at Guggenheim Capital, driving global platform consolidation and organizational enablement across multiple businesses. Earlier roles include People Partner Lead at Square and Cash App (now Block), where she architected People Operations through hyper global growth and IPO readiness. Emily has also advised private equity and venture-backed growth stage fintechs.

Emily holds a BA in business administration and a MBA in international business and human resources from Marquette University.</div>
			
						<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta elementor-has-image elementor-testimonial-image-position-top">
				<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta-inner">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial-image">
							<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="1320" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/emily2.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-11007" alt="" srcset="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/emily2.png 1000w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/emily2-227x300.png 227w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/emily2-776x1024.png 776w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/emily2-768x1014.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" />						</div>
					
										<div class="elementor-testimonial-details">
														<div class="elementor-testimonial-name">Emily Chardac</div>
																						<div class="elementor-testimonial-job">Chief People Officer</div>
													</div>
									</div>
			</div>
					</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d649d32 person elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial" data-id="d649d32" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="testimonial.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-wrapper">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-content">Robert Corti is the Chief Information Officer.

Robert previously served as the Head of Technology Strategy, Delivery, and Compliance for the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE). In that capacity, he managed the NYSE’s technology transformation, which included the migration of the NYSE’s five equities markets, two options markets, and two industry market data processors (CTA &amp; OPRA) to NYSE’s Pillar technology platform. He also managed the firm’s technology compliance and governance function, which included the NYSE’s compliance program for SEC Regulation SCI. Prior to joining the NYSE, Robert held consulting roles at Arthur Andersen, LLP where he advised large companies and major brands on technology and information security projects.

Robert holds an AB in Economics from the College of the Holy Cross and an MBA from Columbia University.</div>
			
						<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta elementor-has-image elementor-testimonial-image-position-top">
				<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta-inner">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial-image">
							<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="1320" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/robert.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-10956" alt="" srcset="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/robert.png 1000w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/robert-227x300.png 227w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/robert-776x1024.png 776w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/robert-768x1014.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" />						</div>
					
										<div class="elementor-testimonial-details">
														<div class="elementor-testimonial-name">Robert Corti</div>
																						<div class="elementor-testimonial-job">Chief Information Officer</div>
													</div>
									</div>
			</div>
					</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4a5861d person elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial" data-id="4a5861d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="testimonial.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-wrapper">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-content">Rohit Mahna is the Chief Revenue Officer.

Rohit brings more than 20 years of experience in financial services and technology to DriveWealth. He joined the firm from Fidelity Institutional, Fidelity’s B2B custody and clearing business, where he served as Head of Client Growth, leading the sales and relationship management teams supporting RIAs, family offices, and brokerage firms. Prior to Fidelity, Rohit spent more than a decade at Salesforce, where he helped architect Financial Services Cloud, the company’s first industry-specific application. 

Rohit holds a BS in Business and Economics from Lehigh University.</div>
			
						<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta elementor-has-image elementor-testimonial-image-position-top">
				<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta-inner">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial-image">
							<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="1320" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/rohit.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-10955" alt="" srcset="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/rohit.png 1000w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/rohit-227x300.png 227w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/rohit-776x1024.png 776w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/rohit-768x1014.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" />						</div>
					
										<div class="elementor-testimonial-details">
														<div class="elementor-testimonial-name">Rohit Mahna</div>
																						<div class="elementor-testimonial-job">Chief Revenue Officer</div>
													</div>
									</div>
			</div>
					</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3d53d0e person elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial" data-id="3d53d0e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="testimonial.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-wrapper">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-content">Barry Metzger is the Chief Brokerage Officer

Barry brings over two decades of executive experience leading large-scale transformation across top financial institutions. Prior to DriveWealth, Barry served as Managing Director of Income and Wealth Solutions at Charles Schwab &amp; Co., Inc., where he played a critical role in integrating the complex trading businesses of Schwab and TD Ameritrade. This work significantly strengthened the firm’s competitive position and support structure for both retail and institutional investors. He previously held the role of CEO of optionsXpress, where he was instrumental in driving innovation in digital brokerage and trading platforms.

Barry holds a BA degree from the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign and an MBA from Northwestern University. </div>
			
						<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta elementor-has-image elementor-testimonial-image-position-top">
				<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta-inner">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial-image">
							<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="1320" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/berry2.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-11008" alt="" srcset="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/berry2.png 1000w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/berry2-227x300.png 227w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/berry2-776x1024.png 776w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/berry2-768x1014.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" />						</div>
					
										<div class="elementor-testimonial-details">
														<div class="elementor-testimonial-name">Barry Metzger</div>
																						<div class="elementor-testimonial-job">Chief Brokerage Officer</div>
													</div>
									</div>
			</div>
					</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3054945 person elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial" data-id="3054945" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="testimonial.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-wrapper">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-content">Brad Roberts is the Chief Risk &amp; Compliance Officer.

Brad joined DriveWealth with extensive leadership experience in global risk management and regulatory oversight across financial markets infrastructure. Most recently, he served as Global Head of Risk Management at Tradeweb, where he was a Managing Director and member of the Operating Committee. Prior to Tradeweb, Brad was Chief Operating Officer of the Risk &amp; Compliance Office at Bloomberg. 

Brad holds a BS in Systems Engineering from the United States Military Academy at West Point, as well as a Securities Industry Institute Certificate in Organizational Leadership from Wharton Executive Education, in addition to other security certifications.</div>
			
						<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta elementor-has-image elementor-testimonial-image-position-top">
				<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta-inner">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial-image">
							<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="1320" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/brad.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-10961" alt="" srcset="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/brad.png 1000w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/brad-227x300.png 227w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/brad-776x1024.png 776w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/brad-768x1014.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" />						</div>
					
										<div class="elementor-testimonial-details">
