				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5608ea4 person elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial" data-id="5608ea4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="testimonial.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-wrapper">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-content">Aaron Sokasian is the Chief Technology Officer.

Aaron co-founded and served as CEO of Financial Labs, which was later acquired by Bank of America. At Bank of America, he led the Quantitative Strategies division.  Aaron later co-founded Crypto-Systems, a proprietary trading firm in the digital asset sector, which was acquired by DriveWealth in 2022. 

Aaron earned a BA in Astrophysics from Cornell University and a PhD in Computational Astrophysics from Harvard University. </div>
			
						<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta elementor-has-image elementor-testimonial-image-position-top">
				<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta-inner">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial-image">
							<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="1320" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/aaron2.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-11009" alt="" srcset="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/aaron2.png 1000w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/aaron2-227x300.png 227w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/aaron2-776x1024.png 776w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/aaron2-768x1014.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" />						</div>
					
										<div class="elementor-testimonial-details">
														<div class="elementor-testimonial-name">Aaron Sokasian</div>
