				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-382db75 person elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial" data-id="382db75" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="testimonial.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-wrapper">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-content">Harry Temkin is the Chief Digital Officer.

Harry is responsible for engaging with a broad range of DriveWealth’s stakeholders, including prospects, partners, and investors, to transform traditional brokerage capabilities into modern API-first workflows. Harry previously served as Vice President of Seller Experience at eBay, Chief Executive Officer of KnowVera, LLC, a financial software company specializing in proprietary trading, and held numerous executive roles at Thomson Reuters and Bridge Information Systems.

Harry served as a Director and Chairman of the Regulatory Oversight Committee of the BATS Stock Exchange from its inception in 2008 through 2015.

Harry graduated Cum Laude from Hobart College with a BA in Economics and Mathematics.</div>
			
						<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta elementor-has-image elementor-testimonial-image-position-top">
				<div class="elementor-testimonial-meta-inner">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial-image">
							<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1000" height="1320" src="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/harry.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-10958" alt="" srcset="https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/harry.png 1000w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/harry-227x300.png 227w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/harry-776x1024.png 776w, https://www.drivewealth.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/harry-768x1014.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" />						</div>
					
