				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6a7b763 person elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial" data-id="6a7b763" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="testimonial.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-wrapper">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial-content">Christopher Yamaguchi is the General Counsel and Corporate Secretary. Christopher also serves as a board member for DriveWealth Lithuania UAB.

Christopher came to DriveWealth from FINRA where he led examinations of various member firms, large multinational, high-risk member firms, and industry sweep initiatives. 

Christopher earned his JD from Seton Hall University School of Law and his BA in Economics and Classics from Bucknell University. </div>
			
